The study of the Russian influence on the American elections will deal with a grand jury
The special Prosecutor for Russia Robert Mueller convened a grand jury in D.C., which will study the influence of Russia on the election of the President of the United States in 2016, according to the newspaper The Wall Street Journal and Reuters.
