During the charity marathon in Melikhov, the choir Vozbedenskaya Davydova Vastina, the belfries of Ilya Drozdykhin's workshop, students of the Tchaikovsky Moscow Conservatoi and the Gnessinsky Russian Academy, artists of the Melikhov Theater "Chekhov Studio".
