Honestly, I don’t do anything now.
There are a number of lawyers who deal with this issue.
As a musician, I’m really sorry that I can’t go to America.
More than once I said I was going to study there.
The more you communicate with real professionals, the more useful.
We don't dwindle, but we don't have that kind of experience at school.
Our performers of popular music for 70 years did not put those tasks that have always been solved by American musicians.
They sought the most high-quality sound as possible.
And I’m trying to follow the same principles.
For some reason, for some reason the United Kingdom refuses me to enter for ten years.
