Has PSG Warned to Bancelona of Neymar crossing three years ago?
Participant of “La Liga” may regret his interest in Marco Verratti
"Pari Saint-Germain" won't stop chasing Neymar after the club offered £189 million for his repurchasing it, but did they not warn Barcelona of setting a world record hit three years?
Sensation offer revitalized the summer transfer window, when the Ligue 1 club was ready to break the world record for the cost of the transition, more than twice the previous mark associated with Paul Pogba's return to Manchester United last season for £89 million.
When the transition ends, Neymar will become the most expensive player in the world, as well as the highest-whealthy professional athlete in the world, since PSG offers him a salary of more than 500 000 pounds a week.
