In Ukraine proposed to send the Russians to prison for illegally crossing the border
In the Verkhovna Rada of Ukraine there is a draft law, according to which a criminal penalty may appear in the republic for Russians for the illegal crossing of the Ukrainian border.
According to RT TV channel, the document registered in the electronic database of the Ukrainian parliament assumes a three-year prison sentence for Russian citizens who are trying to illegally get into the territory of the country.
It is noted that for the repeated offense or an act committed by a group of persons, the term of imprisonment can be increased to five years.
If the violator was detained on the border with a weapon, then the time of detention for him will increase up to eight years.
Earlier it was reported that the Ukrainian border guards detained Ukrainians who tried to get to Russia outside established checkpoints.
Magnite went out into the
The second-largest grocery retrihane "Magnit" announced the opening of three test stores of a new Magnit-Opt format, which are designed to purchase products in small wholesale.
At the same time, the possibility of acquiring goods at retail is preserved, according to the company’s press release.
The stores of a new format worked in Krasnodar, Saratov and Ulyanovsk
Their assortment includes about 1.5 thousand items of food and non-food products.
“The new service will allow companies and russians to make purchases with a financial benefit, and the residents to purchase products in reserve: for a week or a month”, – assured in “Magnit”.
Metro Cash & Carry and Selgros Cash & Carry are already working in the small wholesale segment.
In 2017, Lenta launched a special Lenta program: it invited legal entities and private russians to make purchases at special cash desks of hypermarkets, receive invoices to take into account costs and VAT refund.
The project is aimed at the HoReCa segment, small retail and offices.
In Russia there will be two new territories of advanced social and economic development - "Abaza" and "Novotroitsk".
Corresponding decisions of the Government of the Russian Federation will come into force today, August 4.
Defined the boundaries and types of economic activities of TOR in the city of Abaza in the Republic of Khakassia have been determined.
In the city, where 15 thousand people lives, there will be a special legal regime of entrepreneurial activity, as well as a minimum volume of capital investments of residents, a minimum number of new permanent jobs.
It is assumed that this will involve about 2.5 billion rubles of investments in the city, and more than 600 new jobs will also be created.
In the list of types of economic activities in which TOR "Abaz" there will be a special legal mode of entrepreneurial activity, for example, includes crop production, animal husbandry, the production of foodstuffs, non-alcoholic beverages and clothes.
Now the Government of the Republic has signed framework agreements on the implementation of 8 investment projects.
It is also planned to reduce the residual dependence of the territory on the city-forming enterprise of Abakan Mine LLC.
In January 2017, the authorities of the region reported that Khakassia complied with all the conditions of the Ministry of economic development for the creation of TOR.
The authorities of the Orenburg region also acted in a similar way.
There in the city of Novotroitsk will also be a territory of advanced social and economic development will also be created.
This will diversify the economy of the monocloat, reduce its reliance on the city-forming enterprise Ural Steel JSC, as well as create more than 2.3 thousand jobs and attract investments of more than 8 billion rubles.
In the list of types of economic activities in which a special legal regime for entrepreneurs will act in the new TOR will include, in particular, freshwater fishing, the production of fodder, medicines and medical materials.
Novotroitsk became the first of the monocities of the Orenburg region, which received TOR status.
It will remind that the territory of advanced development is an economic zone with preferential tax conditions, simplified administrative procedures and other privileges, which is being created to attract an investment and improve the life of the population.
Among the privileges for residents of the TOR we can distinguish the following: income tax in the amount not more than 5% during the first five years, and at least 10% over the next 5 years, social contributions in the amount of 7.6% for 10 years, the use of a free customs zone regime, a preferential mode of connection to various infrastructure facilities, as well as preferential rental rates.
The vine called Mansson a “decoction” and threatened to “give in the muzzle”
Yury Loza expressed his indifference to the statements of American rock musician Marilyn Mansson, who insulted Moscow.
In an interview with “Komsomolskaya Pravda”, the Russian singer called Mannson a “screatious” and a “deuce”.
According to Voza, there is no need to invite foreign artists who allow such statements to be invited to Russia.
In addition, Loza believes that Mansson for his words need to be “given in the face”.
We will remind, the American artist, known for his outrageous delicacies, rudely spoke about the Russian capital at a concert in Kiev.
Earlier on Thursday “Arguments of the week” wrote that Mannson’s statement was commented by the domestic producer Joseph Prigozhin.
In Moscow, the policeman wounded a man in the leg, defending himself from an attack
The policeman shot in the thief of the participant of the fight in Moscow after he attacked him with a piece of glass in his hand.
On the evening in the evening in the evening of the OMVD of Internal Affairs in the Yakimanka district there was a message about a fight on Mytnaya Street, 46.
“Arriving an outskirts of the police suppressed the offense and divided the participants of the conflict,” RIA Novosti reported with reference to the press service of the capital’s Interior Ministry.
According to the police, when one of the participants of the conflict attacked an employee of the Ministry of internal Affairs with a piece of glass, a police officer several times warned the man about the use of a weapon and made a warning shot.
This did not stop the hooligan, after which the law enforcement officer shot the man in the leg.
The injured man needed a hospitalization.
